12
00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.839
Defenders of the nation.
I bid thee a fine farewell.

13
00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.200
Make a million. buddy!

14
00:02:47.081 --> 00:02:49.879
Mike. looky there!

15
00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:51.679
Look at that.

16
00:02:52.161 --> 00:02:54.639
Look at that.
See that city out there. kid?

17
